{"id":"9f5c300501e65ad4","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-separator.md","title":"分离集合与可计算不可分对","display":"df-separator — 分离集合与可计算不可分对","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-separator","aliases":["20-df-separator"],"display":"df-separator — 分离集合与可计算不可分对","chapter":"9","section":"9.3","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 9.3.1；Exercise 1.6.26","source_pdf_pages":[55,208],"source_printed_pages":[19,176],"depends_on":["[[20-df-re]]","[[20-df-recursive]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-separator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-separator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-separator — 分离集合与可计算不可分对"},{"key":"chapter","html":"9"},{"key":"section","html":"9.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 9.3.1；Exercise 1.6.26"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>55</span><span>208</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>19</span><span>176</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\cap B=\\varnothing\">\\(A\\cap B=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}separator}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Separates}(S;A,B)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow A\\subseteq S\\land S\\cap B=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{CompInseparable}(A,B)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\nA,B\\in\\mathcal E\\land A\\cap B=\\varnothing\\land\n\\neg\\exists S\\in\\mathcal R\\ \\operatorname{Separates}(S;A,B).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}separator}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Separates}(S;A,B)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow A\\subseteq S\\land S\\cap B=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{CompInseparable}(A,B)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\nA,B\\in\\mathcal E\\land A\\cap B=\\varnothing\\land\n\\neg\\exists S\\in\\mathcal R\\ \\operatorname{Separates}(S;A,B).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>分离集合无须自己 c.e.；要求可计算分离时才加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R\">\\(\\mathcal R\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 9.3.1；Exercise 1.6.26；印刷页 19, 176；PDF 第 55, 208 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"d6dc5974baa6f8