cerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-separator]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。"},{"id":"b1587d880757e9dd","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-special-class]]；see [[20-df-separator]]；see [[20-thm-separation-class]]。"}],"outgoing":["60af447f5d59a8dc","d6dc5974baa6f8a5"]}